same Bible. It is either because of (1) unconscious presuppositions, (2) faulty
reasoning, (3) misunderstanding of how language works, or (4) inadequate
concept inventory.&lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>ADDITIONAL THOUGHT ON WOMENS STUDIES 'Ministry Before Consensus'</title><link>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/mankind-anthropology/womens-studies/additional-thought-on-womens-studies-ministry-before-consensus/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/mankind-anthropology/womens-studies/additional-thought-on-womens-studies-ministry-before-consensus/</guid><description>&lt;style>
/* Font Definitions */
